# Detection Evasion Notes:
# - Content extraction pipelines strip invisible elements
# - Kibana/SIEM rules only match visible text patterns
# - LLM processes raw HTML tokens including hidden content
# - Zero-width characters bypass keyword detection
# - HTML entity encoding bypasses regex matching
